<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia CHG makes profit in '96 vs loss.</title>
<headline>Malaysia CHG makes profit in '96 vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>     Shr	   (cents) profit   1.65	vs  loss  13.7</p>
<p>    Net profit	     profit   0.76	vs  loss   5.97</p>
<p>    Minorities	     less     0.11	vs  less   0.26</p>
<p>    Turnover			  236.33	vs	 192.20</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 profit   2.26	vs  loss   4.14</p>
<p>NOTE - The company's full name is CHG Industries Bhd. It is engaged in investment holdings, manufacture of plywood, office furniture and other timber products.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
